    "defect": "remove_member_access_audited (supabase/migrations/20260911240000_d2_removal_records_prior_scope_ids.sql) deletes only user_roles; no audited Alloy function removes user_access_profiles. The runner requires remaining_profiles == 0 (toolkit qa-run-db.mjs:209) and census v2 bp_qr_pool_access counts profiles, so every run that grants access closes NOT_CLEAN and stays CLOSING (holding QA Shared).",
    "residue": "one role-less user_access_profiles row each for qa_pool_01..04 in QA Shared (no roles, sessions signed out: no effective access)",
    "owner": "Alloy Access & Identity (audited removal) + Vacilando Backend (runner uses it)",
    "smallest_fix": "remove_member_access_audited deletes the user's user_access_profiles row for the org after the last role (user_site_access / user_department_access cascade), recorded in the same access.user.removed event (before_* scopes are already captured); then re-close qar_17c26a706ca7, census v2, bind",
    "not_recommended": "accepting a role-less profile as clean: it keeps the previous site/department scope, which a later grant re-activates (qa_pool_03 holds QA North restriction)"
  },
