    "close": "gar_98543f0123f2bc (toolkit 1d35ef4690f2, run erun2_d5e0013965934e0e): failed qa_run_not_clean \u2014 removed 0, remaining_roles 0, remaining_profiles 1 for qa_pool_01..04; sessions signed out",
    "root_cause": "toolkit lib/qa-run-db.mjs closeQaRun iterates only the orgs in which the identity still has ROLES (roles.map(r => r.org_id)); the first close removed every role, so retries never call remove_member_access_audited and the role-less profiles can never be removed by any close",
    "owner": "Vacilando Backend (QA-run runner)",
    "smallest_fix": "call remove_member_access_audited for every QA org where the identity has a role OR an access profile (the repaired function is idempotent and deletes a residual profile with no second audit event); add a test: a pool identity with 0 roles and 1 QA profile is cleaned by close"
